{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_788eb7b986d8c40f01fa504ef2b120ed6c3b5bb547bfadaf59d6498ebb5b82c3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skill names in ClaudeAgentOptions.skills are validated at connect time; wildcard entries like \"plugin:*\" or \"*\" must be replaced with skills=\"all\" or a Skill(...) rule in allowed_tools."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8188a3ef0ab129c393bbac20970dd3f193c656324f7d7d574215ea880cc7f638"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"On Windows, the SDK refuses to spawn .bat/.cmd CLI scripts and rejects cmd.exe metacharacters in resume/session_id values to prevent command injection."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8266ae1f684292ad3cce1db4ae92229c94bc77ea7e69ad874828fdb79b1758de"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The changelog documents security hardening such as validating skill names to prevent --allowedTools injection and passing --resume/--session-id as single =-joined argv tokens."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e56cc68f5d84e3920961f0d755857c8febc6dfa94c61099c7a4d39a45c711e23"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The mcp dependency was widened to mcp>=1.23.0,<3.0.0, supporting mcp 2.x for in-process servers served over mcp's in-memory transport."}],"claim_ids":["clm_788eb7b986d8c40f01fa504ef2b120ed6c3b5bb547bfadaf59d6498ebb5b82c3","clm_8188a3ef0ab129c393bbac20970dd3f193c656324f7d7d574215ea880cc7f638","clm_8266ae1f684292ad3cce1db4ae92229c94bc77ea7e69ad874828fdb79b1758de","clm_e56cc68f5d84e3920961f0d755857c8febc6dfa94c61099c7a4d39a45c711e23"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:33:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_422ea83d26e94216951e659e75377eec","id":"pg_e596e0bedee15d3ba2e4c44e0355fa55","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/anthropics-claude-agent-sdk-python-changelog-md-37a52c9fb3f0-c44e0355fa55.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_b58652636e515ed68e0e8f86e3a654b8"],"title":"anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python/CHANGELOG.md @ 37a52c9fb3f0","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:33: